      "composition": "single-ornament",
      "description": "An L-shaped engraved ornament for a top-right corner. A dense mass of large, deeply lobed oak leaves, folded and interlaced with looping ribbon-like stems, fills the top-left arm; from the vertex at the top right a long curling stem descends the right side, throwing off smaller lobed leaves and curls, and ends at the bottom in a single acorn in its scaly cup. Black ink with fine hatched shading; the pale grey-cream paper tone is kept inside the leaves and stems, and the background is transparent.",
